    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs; land_basis=terrestrial_forest): Heading is explicitly a dyewood (fustic, Brazil wood, sapan, Nicaragua wood, red/Guinea wood, braziletto); filed with Dye Woods Logwood (htc:0096) rather than building timber. Layer-1 observations: 176 rows, 1800–1869. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×109; HCPP_Other ×54; KEW_CUST 4 ×7; KEW_CUST 5 ×6. Units: Tons ×169; Tons.Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×7. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×15; Mexico → United Kingdom ×12; Brazil → United Kingdom ×11; New Granada → United Kingdom ×10."@en ;
