    skos:related <id/01/0159/#concept>, <id/03/0308/#concept>, <id/03/0367/#concept>, <id/04/0480/#concept>, <id/04/0494/#concept>, <id/05/0505/#concept>, <id/06/0628/#concept>, <id/06/0654/#concept>, <id/07/0740/#concept>, <id/08/0810/#concept>, <id/08/0820/#concept>, <id/08/0862/#concept>, <id/08/0893/#concept>, <id/09/0918/#concept>, <id/09/0992/#concept>, <id/10/1003/#concept>, <id/10/1041/#concept>, <id/11/1122/#concept>, <id/11/1144/#concept>, <id/12/1236/#concept>, <id/12/1277/#concept>, <id/12/1292/#concept>, <id/14/1489/#concept>, <id/15/1512/#concept>, <id/16/1671/#concept>, <id/17/1715/#concept>, <id/17/1716/#concept>, <id/17/1725/#concept>, <id/17/1782/#concept>, <id/18/1846/#concept>, <id/18/1896/#concept>, <id/18/1897/#concept>, <id/19/1910/#concept>, <id/19/1941/#concept> ;
